		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Wagon-sized fungi-farming beetle with a cloud giant's face. Not hostile, curious about surface folk. Grows geometrically arranged gardens. Vermin whisperer.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +9 (2d6) or 1 acid spit (far) +7, <strong>MV</strong> near(climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Spit</strong>. Launch a globule of acidic spittle, 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vermin Whisperer</strong>. Speak with rats, bats, and other vermin. CHA 15+ or vermin must obey commands for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
